OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer who threw stash into
OL,4,Agarden jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer who threw cocaine and
OL,7,Fcannabis into a garden in Hereford
OL,8,Fbefore hiding from police has been
OL,9,Fjailed for four and a half years.
OL,11,FLawrence Cardoso, 20, of no fixed
OL,12,Fabode, pleaded guilty at Worcester
OL,13,FCrown Court, sitting at Hereford, to
OL,14,Fpossessing cocaine and cannabis with
OL,15,Fintent to supply.
OL,17,FCardoso was sentenced on Tuesday to 30
OL,18,Fmonths in a young offenders'
OL,19,Finstitution.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
